# Goes to <volume>/config/acl. See ../README.md.
#
# While the probe runs, both users may use everything below usp/: AVM's documentation leaves open which of the two
# topics of a controller the box subscribes to and which it publishes to. Narrow this down once the probe has shown
# it - whoever may publish to the box's topic controls the box within the rights its controller has.

user fritzbox-neufahrn
topic readwrite usp/#

user usp-probe
topic readwrite usp/#
